<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Giorgio III Ghisi</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1390</span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Giorgio III Ghisi was the last Ghisi lord of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tinos">Tinos</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mykonos">Mykonos</a> in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cyclades">Cyclades</a>. When he died in 1390 he bequeathed the islands to the Republic of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/venice">Venice</a>, which ruled Tinos until it fell to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottomans</a> in 1715.</p></div>
